{"id":"ceace217227e928b","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-set12-family-support.md","title":"Support of an Indexed Family","display":"df-zfc-set12-family-support — Support of an Indexed Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set12-family-support","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set12-family-support"],"display":"df-zfc-set12-family-support — Support of an Indexed Family","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set12-family-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set12-family-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set12-family-support — Support of an Indexed Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-zfc-set12-family-support-—-ZFC-Set12-Family-Support\">df-zfc-set12-family-support — ZFC Set12 Family Support</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,F,I,Y,0_Y\\in V\">\\(S,F,I,Y,0_Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12FamilySupport}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12FamilySupport}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}family\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12FamilySupport}_S(S,F,I,Y,0_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(F,I,Y)\\land0_Y\\in Y\\land S\\subseteq I\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(i\\in S\\leftrightarrow F(i)\\neq0_Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}family\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12FamilySupport}_S(S,F,I,Y,0_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(F,I,Y)\\land0_Y\\in Y\\land S\\subseteq I\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(i\\in S\\leftrightarrow F(i)\\neq0_Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The index set, codomain, and distinguished zero are explicit, so the support is uniquely determined as a subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-zfc-set12-family-support-—-ZFC-Set12-Family-Support","text":"df-zfc-set12-family-support — ZFC Set12 Family Support","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · dep